extraneous solutions.

06:56.319 --> 06:57.180
It would have been solutions

06:57.180 --> 06:58.902
for some of our intermediate steps,

06:58.902 --> 07:01.424
but not for the actual original equations

07:01.424 --> 07:03.066
with the expressions as they're written.

07:03.066 --> 07:05.448
But this, we can feel good
about because neither of these

07:05.448 --> 07:09.781
make any of these
denominators equal to zero.
